{"id":"cc8aa6176e667d4d520143b5a1b0a26629609f96","url":"https://www.producthunt.com/products/openai","title":"OpenAI: APIs and tools for building AI products | Product Hunt","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Product Hunt · 今日新产品","byline":"Dominik Kundel","excerpt":"The most powerful platform for building AI products. Build and scale AI experiences powered by industry-leading models and tools.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div data-test=\"launch\"><div><p>This is the 46th launch from OpenAI. </p><a href=\"/products/openai/launches\"><span>View more</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.667\" d=\"M3.334 8.909h9.333m0 0L8.001 4.242m4.666 4.667-4.666 4.666\" /></svg></a></div><div><div><h2>Health in ChatGPT</h2><p>Launching today</p></div><p><span>Your personal health companion, powered by ChatGPT</span></p></div><p>Health in ChatGPT helps you better understand and navigate your health by bringing your health information into one conversation. Connect your health data, medical records, and wellness apps to get more personalized insights, track changes over time, prepare for appointments, understand results, and build healthier routines — all while staying in control of what you share.</p><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"44\" height=\"45\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 44 45\"><g filter=\"url(#ChevronRight_svg__a)\"><path fill=\"#fff\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" d=\"M0 22.614c0-12.15 9.85-22 22-22s22 9.85 22 22-9.85 22-22 22-22-9.85-22-22\" /><path stroke=\"#344054\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m19 28.614 6-6-6-6\" /></g><defs><filter id=\"ChevronRight_svg__a\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" x=\"-8\" y=\"-7.386\" color-interpolation-filters=\"sRGB\" filterUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><feflood flood-opacity=\"0\" result=