n ChatGPTLaunching todayYour personal health companion, powered by ChatGPTHealth in ChatGPT helps you better understand and navigate your health by bringing your health information into one conversation. Connect your health data, medical records, and wellness apps to get more personalized insights, track changes over time, prepare for appointments, understand results, and build healthier routines — all while staying in control of what you share.Free OptionsLaunch Team","fetched_at":"2026-07-25T10:33:24.109Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p>This is the 46th launch from OpenAI. </p>","sentences":[{"en":"This is the 46th launch from OpenAI.","zh":"这是 OpenAI 第 46 次发布。"}]},{"html_en":"<h2>Health in ChatGPT</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Health in ChatGPT","zh":"ChatGPT 中的健康状况"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Launching today</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Launching today","zh":"今天推出"}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Your personal health companion, powered by ChatGPT</span></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Your personal health companion, powered by ChatGPT","zh":"您的个人健康伴侣，由 ChatGPT 提供支持"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Health in ChatGPT helps you better understand and navigate your health by bringing your health information into one conversation. Connect your health data, medical records, and wellness apps to get more personalized insights, track changes over time, prepare for appointments, understand results, and build healthier routines — all while staying in control of what you share.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Health in ChatGPT helps you better understand and navigate your health by bringing your health information into one conversation.","zh":"ChatGPT 中的健康状况可将您的健康信息纳入一次对话中，帮助您更好地了解和掌握您的健康状况。"},{"en":"Connect your health data, medical records, and wellness apps to get more personalized insights, track changes over time, prepare for appointments, understand results, and build healthier routines — all while staying in control of what you share.","zh":"连接您的健康数据、医疗记录和健康应用程序，以获得更个性化的见解、跟踪随时间的变化、准备预约、了解结果并建立更健康的日常生活 - 同时保持对您分享的内容的控制。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Free Options</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Free Options","zh":"免费选项"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Launch Team </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Launch Team","zh":"发射团队"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div data-test=\"launch\"><div><p>这是 OpenAI 第 46 次发布。</p><a href=\"/products/openai/launches\"><span>View more</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 17\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.667\" d=\"M3.334 8.909h9.333m0 0L8.001 4.242m4.666 4.667-4.666 4.666\" /></svg></a></div><div><div><h2>ChatGPT 中的健康状况</h2><p>今天推出</p></div><p>您的个人健康伴侣，由 ChatGPT 提供支持</p></div><p>ChatGPT 中的健康状况可将您的健康信息纳入一次对话中，帮助您更好地了解和掌握您的健康状况。 连接您的健康数据、医疗记录和健康应用程序，以获得更个性化的见解、跟踪随时间的变化、准备预约、了解结果并建立更健康的日常生活 - 同时保持对您分享的内容的控制。</p><div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"44\" height=\"45\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 44 45\"><g filter=\"url(#ChevronRight_svg__a)\"><path fill=\"#fff\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" d=\"M0 22.614c0-12.15 9.85-22 22-22s22 9.85 22 22-9.85 22-22 22-22-9.85-22-22\" /><path stroke=\"#344054\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"m19 28.614 6-6-6-6\" /></g><defs><filter id=\"ChevronRight_svg__a\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\" x=\"-8\" y=\"-7.386\" color-interpolation-filters=\"sRGB\" filterUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><feflood flood-opacity=\"0\" result=\"BackgroundImageFix\" /><fegaussianblur in=\"BackgroundImageFix\" stdDeviation=\"4\" /><fecomposite in2=\"SourceAlpha\" operator=\"in\" result=\"effect1_backgroundBlur_5592_12221\" /><feblend in=\"SourceGraphic\" in2=\"effect1_backgroundBlur_5592_12221\" result=\"shape\" /></filter></defs></svg><section><div aria-label=\"Health in ChatGPT gallery media\"><p><img src=\"https://ph-files.imgix.net/07bd412f-47ba-4d4f-83d3-4451ec21d99c.webp?auto=compress&codec=mozjpeg&cs=strip&dpr=2&fit=max&fm=webp&frame=1&h=220&w=391